Tests in this folder are adapted from web-platform-tests under the
BSD-3-Clause license:
https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/tree/96c61ac7c21f7f37526d1c03c4c6087734524130/selectors-api

They are used to test the implementation of querySelector/querySelectorAll.

Not all code was ported; as the current implementation doesn't yet support
all features of those methods.
